Title: Convert World Bank Data from Wide to Long Format
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tallinn", "Splinter", , "tallinn.splinter@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a function to convert World Bank mortality data
    from wide to long format. The function organizes mortality data by
    country and year to facilitate data analysis.
